          "retained": [
            "Retain four-target NEON lanes, ascending source order, and double-precision sqrt/division before float conversion.",
            "Integrate alternating state buffers with a persistent OpenMP team, fusing force accumulation, velocity updates, and position integration.",
            "Statically distribute vector blocks without a barrier, then scalar tails with one barrier completing each timestep.",
            "Retain the original serial simulation below 128 bodies or on allocation failure, the standalone body_force entry point, and non-NEON or fast-math scalar fallbacks."
